From c924d97e5c20de4ba6d6d11d0f9404fc52450a99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:52:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Fix round 7, sheet: draft, cues and small sheet items

69.1 a refused sheet edit reopens the editor with its draft and the reason; the gear
dialog applies only its own additions and removals to the live list. 69.2 the typed
question empties when the server has paid. 69.5/69.6 the long trauma-edit and refill
lines sit behind an i. 69.8a the ability card is headed by the ability's own role.
45.11 empty gear says it in the tag; 45.12 the You card shows Standing; 45.14 closed
reports show the filed card; 45.15 the scar list takes the scroll ref; 60.10 sketch text
size and room for Keep drawing; 60.11 spent cue by the stepper; 60.16 skip link, 44px
steppers; 60.17 Proposed stamp; 60.18 Chapter House status; 60.21 Edit label; 60.22
sticky gear footer. Built with vite; browser check follows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WaLz6UBTQ5XaTKSYwqeMKA
